OL,3,ADoor was locked at Pakistan hospital
OL,4,Awhere fire killed 14 babies, witnesses
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was just after dawn on Wednesday
OL,8,Fmorning at a maternity ward in the
OL,9,FPakistani capital when a horrific blaze
OL,10,Ferupted.
OL,12,FIt would go on to kill 14 infants as
OL,13,Fparents say they waited hours for help
OL,14,Fto arrive.
OL,16,FHivsa Walid was near the room at the
OL,17,FPakistan Institute of Medical Sciences
OL,18,F(PIMS) hospital with her sister-in-law,
OL,19,Fwho had given birth days earlier. She
OL,20,Finitially heard a shout and thought a
OL,21,Fpatient had died - but then she saw
OL,22,Fsmoke.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
